    <line startX="368" startY="108" endX="368" endY="472"><border color="rgb(201, 192, 172)" width="1"/></line>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="400" topLeftY="108" width="400" height="26">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgb(94, 42, 42)" bold="true" wrap="false"><p>传统路径的三条局限</p></content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="400" topLeftY="146" width="512" height="66">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13.5" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgb(38, 34, 29)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5">
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgb(94, 42, 42)">站均值 / 欧氏插值（Kriging）</span>　只看空间邻近，忽略河网连通与水流方向，空间外推弱</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="400" topLeftY="214" width="512" height="66">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13.5" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgb(38, 34, 29)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5">
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgb(94, 42, 42)">表格特征模型（Random Forest / MLP）</span>　把站点当作独立点，未利用上下游因果结构</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="400" topLeftY="282" width="512" height="66">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13.5" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgb(38, 34, 29)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5">
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgb(94, 42, 42)">普通 GCN</span>　把邻域作无向平均，与河流「有向输运」的物理过程不符</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <line startX="400" startY="366" endX="912" endY="366"><border color="rgb(216, 209, 192)" width="1"/></line>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="400" topLeftY="380" width="512" height="24">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgb(122, 116, 106)" wrap="false"><p>核心矛盾</p></content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="400" topLeftY="408" width="512" height="58">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="15.5" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgb(94, 42, 42)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4">
        <p>观测高度稀疏，而河网本身携带被忽略的强结构先验——</p>
        <p>问题是如何把这一先验变成可学习、可检验的模型。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <line startX="48" startY="508" endX="912" endY="508"><border color="rgb(201, 192, 172)" width="1"/></line>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="514" width="520" height="16">
      <content textType="caption" fontSize="9" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgb(150, 143, 130)" wrap="false"><p>来源：USGS NWIS 站点目录（pcode 00681，1972–2026），统计口径见 scripts/fetch_doc_inventory.py</p></content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="800" topLeftY="514" width="112" height="16">
      <content textType="caption" fontSize="9" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgb(150, 143, 130)" textAlign="right" wrap="false"><p>03 / 18</p></content>
    </shape>
  </data>
  <note>
    <content textType="body">
      <p>先看问题的量级：流域内近一万两千个站点测过 DOC，但真正有可用序列的只有约 570 个，时空格子的观测覆盖率只有 8.9%。</p>
      <p>三类传统方法各有盲区：插值忽略河网，表格模型忽略站点间因果，普通 GCN 又丢掉了流向。</p>
      <p>所以核心矛盾是：数据稀疏，但河网拓扑是一个免费的强先验，本研究要回答它到底能补回多少信息。</p>
    </content>
  </note>
